1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,109
On Mars, there is no doctor on board — and Earth takes 22 minutes to reply.

2
00:00:05,239 --> 00:00:11,838
Pulse-0G doesn't diagnose or dump raw numbers: it compares you to your own baseline and guides action.

3
00:00:11,968 --> 00:00:19,626
It runs offline and never guesses. Missing data stays blank; any unverified claim is struck out.

4
00:00:19,756 --> 00:00:25,463
Built on open NASA data, ready to plug into European and Canadian space wearables.

5
00:00:25,593 --> 00:00:29,575
Pulse-0G: traceable health decisions.
